# v2 frontend only

There is **no v1 UI**. The deprecated vanilla-JS `public/` tree has been removed.

- All frontend work goes in **`frontend/`** (React 19 + Vite + TypeScript).
- Visual source of truth: **`STYLE_GUIDE_V2.md`**.
- Architecture and dev workflow: **`docs/current/FRONTEND_V2.md`**.
- Local dev URL: **`http://localhost:5173`** (Vite); API on `:8085`.
- Mobile/desktop layout: **`LayoutModeProvider`** / `useLayoutMode()` at 900px — not v1 `layout-mobile` classes.

Do not reference `public/`, `EXCELSIOR_DISABLE_SPA`, legacy script manifests, or v1 style/mobile docs as active code. Historical v1 docs are in **`docs/archive/`**.
